# Line endings
#
# Every blob in this repository is LF. Without this file, a machine with a
# global core.autocrlf=true checks the tree out as CRLF, and a shell script
# with a CRLF shebang then fails to run with "bad interpreter".
#
# `text=auto` lets git detect binaries itself; `eol=lf` pins the working copy
# to LF on every platform, so scripts stay executable after a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf
